# CodeTree demo: CLI output and the LSP correction diff
Output docs/cli.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 750
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "cd ~/dev/ct-samples/goshape"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "ct ."
Enter
Sleep 1800ms

Type "ct -lsp -f mermaid ."
Enter
Sleep 3500ms

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
